{"id":"wb-7-1159","name":"五龙口古代水利设施","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"五龙口古代水利设施","text":"五龙口古代水利设施位于中华人民共和国河南省济源市五龙口镇沁河出山口处，为河南省开创年代最久、保存最为完好的古代水利设施之一，也是中国水利史上第一个采用暗渠进行隔山取水的水利工程。五龙口兴修水利的历史最早可追溯至秦朝，曹魏、唐朝、元朝均在此修渠，至明朝时期建成5条水渠，故称“五龙口”。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%BA%94%E9%BE%99%E5%8F%A3%E5%8F%A4%E4%BB%A3%E6%B0%B4%E5%88%A9%E8%AE%BE%E6%96%BD","revisionId":93940329,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93940329","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/eb8065df38c57d979fa604d4.jpg","title":"20250716_Wulongkou_Ancient_Hydraulic_System_05.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20250716_Wulongkou_Ancient_Hydraulic_System_05.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e5/20250716_Wulongkou_Ancient_Hydraulic_System_05.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​济源五龙口古代水利设施 三公祠（左）和袁公祠（右）","width":320,"height":213}}